//TWO-HANDED SWORD +1 - 2000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/SW2H02.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Two-Handed Sword"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "The two-handed sword is a derivative of the long sword. Weaponsmiths have always looked for ways to improve existing weapons. In an effort to improve the long sword, the blade was lengthened. Eventually, the handle had to be extended and two hands became necessary to properly swing the sword. The primary function of two-handed swords is cleaving mounted knights and breaking up pike formations.

STATISTICS:

Damage: 2d6 (slashing)
Speed Factor: 10
Proficiency Type: Two-handed Sword
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 15 Strength

Weight: 15"

SAY NAME2 "Two-handed Sword +1"
	SAY DESC "The two-handed sword is a derivative of the long sword. Weaponsmiths have always looked for ways to improve existing weapons. In an effort to improve the long sword, the blade was lengthened. Eventually, the handle had to be extended and two hands became necessary to properly swing the sword. The primary function of two-handed swords is cleaving mounted knights and breaking up pike formations. This one is particularly good at its job as it has been enchanted with a few magical properties.

STATISTICS:

THAC0: +1
Damage: 2d6+1 (slashing)
Speed Factor: 9
Proficiency Type: Two-handed Sword
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 15 Strength

Weight: 12" 






