	SAY DESC "This sword performs perfectly under every test, save the heat of battle. Upon entering combat, the wielder have a lot o chance to go berserk, killing everything within reach until either calming down or falling unconscious. A very powerful sword, but one must decide whether or not it is worth the risk.

STATISTICS:

Combat abilities:
– Chance to go berserk 25% every hit (same bonuses as a Berserker Rage, but cannot be controlled).

THAC0: +3
