	SAY NAME2 "Ir'revrykal +5"
	SAY DESC "This massive silver blade radiates a cold luminescence that seems to vibrate in sync with the currents of the Astral Plane. Forged by the greatest weapon-smiths of the Githyanki people, Ir'revrykal is not merely a sword, but a symbol of millennial resistance and vengeance. The runes etched along its flat surface are not prayers, but equations of pure mental force designed to shatter the psychic cohesion of the enemy.While its true nature remains shrouded in mystery, Githyanki legends recount that it was tempered in the blood of Illithids during the great uprising that liberated their kin. It is the ultimate 'Cerebro-Killer' weapon: its blade does not simply sever flesh, but shears the very connections between mind and body, making it the living nightmare of any Mind Flayer that dares cross its path. For a Githyanki warrior, to wield Ir'revrykal is to brandish the absolute will of the Eternal Queen against the brain-eaters.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Immunity to confusion and all psionic attacks

Combat abilities:
– 15% chance per hit that target must save vs. Death at -4 or die
- Slays Mind Flayers

THAC0: +5
Damage: 2d6+5
Damage type: Slashing
Speed Factor: 5
Proficiency Type: Two-handed Sword
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 15 Strength

Weight: 10"